### Test Authentication & User API
### Base URL: http://localhost:3226

### 1. Register a new user
POST http://localhost:3226/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "full_name": "Test User",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### 2. Register another user
POST http://localhost:3226/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "full_name": "Admin User",
  "password": "adminpass123"
}

###

### 3. Login
POST http://localhost:3226/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### 4. Get current user info (replace TOKEN with actual token from login)
GET http://localhost:3226/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

###

### 5. Get all users (admin only - requires admin token)
GET http://localhost:3226/auth/users
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

###

### 6. Get all users via users endpoint
GET http://localhost:3226/users

###

### 7. Create user via users endpoint
POST http://localhost:3226/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "newuser@example.com",
  "full_name": "New User",
  "password": "newpass123"
}

###

### 8. Get user by email
GET http://localhost:3226/users/test@example.com

###
